{"3767290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TRIUM", "steam_appid": 3767290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed as part of a new employee training program at Byking Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your PC environment, the game may not function properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected issues or bugs may also occur during gameplay. Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼About 'TRIUM'</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an on-rails virus-killing action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate viruses to speed up and reach the goal as fast as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>&quot;I am 'TRIUM', an antivirus program implemented to protect your world. Nice to meet you.&quot;</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼A digital world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes control of 'TRIUM', a humanoid antivirus program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is to capture the 'Intruder', a large-form virus aiming to destroy the core of our digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/50c14757f0b3f4393a1129e5ebad2e44.avif?t=1765850468\" width=1560 height=904 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼Destroy the viruses to accelerate!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor-viruses block the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'TRIUM' is able to speed up by absorbing energy from destroyed viruses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy any minor-viruses in sight,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >then speed up and capture the runaway 'Intruder'!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼Simple yet authentic 3-button action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to use only 3 buttons to play the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick: Use your kick ability to destroy minor viruses in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane shift: Jump to adjacent lanes to crush enemies coming up alongside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/57f49c95c64c131b179f11055d9f1503.poster.avif?t=1765850468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/57f49c95c64c131b179f11055d9f1503.webm?t=1765850468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/57f49c95c64c131b179f11055d9f1503.mp4?t=1765850468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼Ending scenes change based on your score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You earn different endings based on your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 'secret ending' may also await those who attain the highest rank...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/fd410435101c31e490bcf880b41d1b3e.avif?t=1765850468\" width=1560 height=894 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed as part of a new employee training program at Byking Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your PC environment, the game may not function properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected issues or bugs may also occur during gameplay. Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼About 'TRIUM'</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an on-rails virus-killing action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate viruses to speed up and reach the goal as fast as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>&quot;I am 'TRIUM', an antivirus program implemented to protect your world. Nice to meet you.&quot;</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼A digital world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes control of 'TRIUM', a humanoid antivirus program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is to capture the 'Intruder', a large-form virus aiming to destroy the core of our digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/50c14757f0b3f4393a1129e5ebad2e44.avif?t=1765850468\" width=1560 height=904 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼Destroy the viruses to accelerate!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor-viruses block the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'TRIUM' is able to speed up by absorbing energy from destroyed viruses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy any minor-viruses in sight,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >then speed up and capture the runaway 'Intruder'!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼Simple yet authentic 3-button action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to use only 3 buttons to play the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick: Use your kick ability to destroy minor viruses in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lane shift: Jump to adjacent lanes to crush enemies coming up alongside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/57f49c95c64c131b179f11055d9f1503.poster.avif?t=1765850468\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/57f49c95c64c131b179f11055d9f1503.webm?t=1765850468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/57f49c95c64c131b179f11055d9f1503.mp4?t=1765850468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▼Ending scenes change based on your score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You earn different endings based on your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 'secret ending' may also await those who attain the highest rank...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/extras/fd410435101c31e490bcf880b41d1b3e.avif?t=1765850468\" width=1560 height=894 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Simple yet authentic 3-button action. Take control of the humanoid antivirus 'TRIUM', in this on-rails virus-killing action game. Eliminate viruses, speed up, and catch up to the 'Intruder' virus that started this mess!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/c01522930ef6da8cf7f0f2f7789ddadabfe1cb94/header.jpg?t=1765850468", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/852bba93c0c782df210c2937093009195209f368/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765850468", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767290/852bba93c0c782df210c2937093009195209f368/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765850468", "website": "https://byking.jp/#1", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 3770<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong